  "edge_schema": "voltmarkt_edge_sort",
  "prompt": "Among the promotions that started in 2025 (start_date from 1 January 2025 to 31 December 2025, both days included), which 3 gave the deepest discount? Return promo_code, promo_type, discount_pct and start_date, in that order, with exactly these column names, highest discount_pct first. When promotions tie on discount_pct, the one with the earlier start_date comes first and wins the place. A promotion with no discount_pct does not count. Return exactly 3 rows.",
